Visual prompt studio1.1- The sci-fi film poster challenge 

Give me a futuristic colosseum where monsters and aliens fight. Add the galaxy in the background, with viewers giving thumbs up and down, and a human in the middle as the emperor. Make it a movie poster . I want the figures to have organic lines and the colosseum and the surrounding areas to have geometric lines . I want the Colosseum to be the biggest shape and take up most of the image . Make the arena and figures take up the most space, with little space left . I want the Colosseum to be rough and rocky 
I want the Colosseum to be tall and the characters to look heavy. Make the emperor's face light so he sticks out 
Line - A straight figure pointing in a specific direction 
Shape - A figure that defines the perimeter of an object 
Texture - the feeling of something or a defined look it may give off 
Volume - the space in something that is filled up or the amount of something 
Contrast- the visual and drastic differences of something 
